# R2 (F01/F04): the SAME typed negative through build and run actions —
# language failures are observations on every action, never gate-2 errors.
```test-case
case { schema: "autolang.case/2", id: "ac.src.undefined-build", source: { text: "fn main() int { return x }", syntax: "auto", path: "main.at" }, entry: { mode: "program" }, checks: [ { id: "bld", adapter: "ac", action: "build", expect: { completion: { stage: "resolve", code: "source.undefined" } } } ] }
```
```test-case
